{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>בחסר ובכפן</b> — Targum [renders it as] hunger." "<b>גלמוד</b> — a place without settlement." "<b>העורקים</b> — those who flee to desolation. Targum [of] וינס וערק. And at night they are in a place of desolation."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:58.783837101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}